# 분리 창의 터미널에서 계정으로 시작하면 새 터미널이 같은 분리 창에 들어간다(창을 닫고 다시 열지 않는다). 준비물은 account-switch-fixture.sh다.
waittabs 1 @30000
waitstate cwd=C: @30000
act tabadd
waittabs 2 @30000
act movetowindow 2
waitstate detached=2 @10000
sendto 2 echo SW-READY\r
wait 5000
state before-switch
act startwin 1 A
act movetowindow 1
state switching-refused
waitstate status=Wait for the account switch to finish before moving this tab. @5000
waitnostate detached=1 @1000
waitstate account-switch switching=no @30000
wait 4000
act startwin 2 A
waitstate detached=4 @30000
waitstate account-switch switching=no @30000
wait 4000
state after-switch
textwin 4 echo after-switch-key
keywin 4 enter
wait 1500
dumptab 2 switched-grid
shot after-switch
shotwin 2 detached-after-switch
act quick quitstop
wait 3000
